#
# SHA-512 cryptographic hash function per FIPS 180-4. Produces a 64-byte
# (512-bit) message digest. Uses 64-bit word operations natively matching
# Uranite's I64 type. Used by HMAC-SHA-512 for Kafka SCRAM-SHA-512 SASL.
#
